{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38865","headline":"寄临海姚中丞 · 杜荀鹤","name":"寄临海姚中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夏辞旌斾已秋深，永夕思量泪满襟。\n风月易斑搜句鬓，星霜难改感恩心。\n寻花洞里连春醉，望海楼中彻晓吟。\n虽有梦魂知处所，去来多被角声侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}